<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-c6ac190543&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2024-03-29T01:07:15Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;h1>&lt;a id=\&#34;plaintiff\&#34;>&lt;/a>Information for People Suing Someone (Plaintiffs)&lt;/h1>\r\n&lt;p>Follow the steps below to sue someone in small claims. Click on one of the headings for details.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-c6ac190543" class="cmp-text">
    <h1><a id="plaintiff"></a>Information for People Suing Someone (Plaintiffs)</h1>
<p>Follow the steps below to sue someone in small claims. Click on one of the headings for details.</p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/text_1813104464.forms.html"/></div>
<div class="accordion panelcontainer aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><div id="accordion-533ada815f" class="cmp-accordion " data-cmp-is="accordion" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-533ada815f&#34;:{&#34;shownItems&#34;:[],&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-02-05T21:00:01Z&#34;}}" data-placeholder-text="false">
    <div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-533ada815f-item-e1eab47016&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T23:00:31Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Step 1 - Know the Limits in Small Claims Court&#34;}}" id="accordion-533ada815f-item-e1eab47016">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-533ada815f-item-e1eab47016-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-533ada815f-item-e1eab47016-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Step 1 - Know the Limits in Small Claims Court">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Step 1 - Know the Limits in Small Claims Court</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-533ada815f-item-e1eab47016-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-533ada815f-item-e1eab47016-button"><div class="text">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-e1eab47016&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T23:00:31Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>You can only sue someone to get money in small claims cases. You cannot ask the court to order the other person to do something (like give back property). The most you can ask for is $20,000. That amount includes lawyer fees, but does not include court costs or interest.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;sub>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.utcourts.gov/statutes/?s=78A-8-102\&#34;>Utah Code Section 78A-8-102&lt;/a>.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/sub>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>You cannot sue a government agency or sue to evict someone. You might want advice if your case doesn’t fit these limits. See our &lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/legal-help/finding-legal-help/legal-assist.html\&#34;>Finding Legal Help page&lt;/a> to learn more.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;sub>Utah Code &lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.utcourts.gov/statutes/?s=63G-7-201\&#34;>63G-7-201&lt;/a>, and &lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.utcourts.gov/statutes/?s=78A-8-102\&#34;>78A-8-102&lt;/a>.&lt;/sub>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>&lt;br>\r\nIs your case about a car accident? &lt;/b>Keep reading for more details. If not, skip to step 2.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If someone damaged your property (like your car) in a car accident, you can also sue for injuries.&amp;nbsp;If you sue for injuries you can either:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>Sue for injuries in the same small claims case, or&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>File a separate case for injuries&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;sub>Utah Code &lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.utcourts.gov/statutes/?s=78A-8-102\&#34;>78A-8-102&lt;/a>.&lt;/sub>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;br>\r\nIf you file two cases, one case does not decide the other. You could win property but lose injury.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If you file two cases, only ask for property damage in the property case. Don&#39;t ask for more property damage in the injury case.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-e1eab47016" class="cmp-text">
    <p>You can only sue someone to get money in small claims cases. You cannot ask the court to order the other person to do something (like give back property). The most you can ask for is $20,000. That amount includes lawyer fees, but does not include court costs or interest. </p>
<p><sub><a href="https://www.utcourts.gov/statutes/?s&#61;78A-8-102">Utah Code Section 78A-8-102</a>. </sub></p>
<p>You cannot sue a government agency or sue to evict someone. You might want advice if your case doesn’t fit these limits. See our <a class="rfcu-link" href="/en/self-help/legal-help/finding-legal-help/legal-assist.html">Finding Legal Help page</a> to learn more.</p>
<p><sub>Utah Code <a href="https://www.utcourts.gov/statutes/?s&#61;63G-7-201">63G-7-201</a>, and <a href="https://www.utcourts.gov/statutes/?s&#61;78A-8-102">78A-8-102</a>.</sub></p>
<p><b><br />
Is your case about a car accident? </b>Keep reading for more details. If not, skip to step 2.  <br />
</p>
<p>If someone damaged your property (like your car) in a car accident, you can also sue for injuries. If you sue for injuries you can either:</p>
<ul><li><p>Sue for injuries in the same small claims case, or</p>
</li><li><p>File a separate case for injuries</p>
</li></ul>
<p><sub>Utah Code <a href="https://www.utcourts.gov/statutes/?s&#61;78A-8-102">78A-8-102</a>.</sub></p>
<p><br />
If you file two cases, one case does not decide the other. You could win property but lose injury.</p>
<p>If you file two cases, only ask for property damage in the property case. Don&#39;t ask for more property damage in the injury case.</p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion/item_1.forms.html"/></div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-533ada815f-item-fbac1d9934&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-10-06T15:53:11Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Step 2 - Decide Where to File&#34;}}" id="accordion-533ada815f-item-fbac1d9934">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-533ada815f-item-fbac1d9934-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-533ada815f-item-fbac1d9934-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Step 2 - Decide Where to File">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Step 2 - Decide Where to File</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-533ada815f-item-fbac1d9934-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-533ada815f-item-fbac1d9934-button"><div class="text">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-fbac1d9934&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-10-06T15:53:11Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Small claims cases are usually filed in a justice court (except in Cache County, where there isn&#39;t a County-wide justice court. If the action or defendant are not in the jurisdiction of the remaining justice courts in Cache County, then you file in district court).&amp;nbsp; You have two options for where to file:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>where the defendant lives, or&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>where the events happened&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Are you suing a business?&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;Most businesses must register with the Department of Commerce. You can use their &lt;a href=\&#34;https://secure.utah.gov/bes/index.html\&#34;>Business Search&lt;/a> to find where a business “lives.” This tells you which court to file in. You can also find out how to serve them (read more in Step 4 below).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Are you suing a skilled worker and do not know their address? &lt;/b>A skilled worker is someone like a dentist, a contractor, or a beautician.&amp;nbsp;Many skilled workers must also register with the Department of Commerce. &lt;a href=\&#34;https://admin.commerce.utah.gov/programs-we-administer/who-must-register-with-the-department-of-commerce/\&#34;>Find links and search for people registered in those occupations&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>How to find the right justice court&lt;br>\r\n &lt;/b>You need to file in the right justice court. File in the:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>City or town justice court if they have one, and&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>County justice court, if no city or town court, and&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>District court if no county court (only Cache County has none)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>Use the &lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/about/miscellaneous/directory.html\&#34;>court directory&lt;/a> to find the right justice court.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Some cities and counties use another city or county’s justice court. If yours does, it means there is no courthouse in your city or county, but the court still exists legally. This affects where you file.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Use this table to see which cities and counties share courts, and where to file.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;table cellpadding=\&#34;2\&#34; cellspacing=\&#34;0\&#34; border=\&#34;1\&#34;>\r\n&lt;tbody>&lt;tr>&lt;th>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;th scope=\&#34;col\&#34;>If you would normally file in...&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;th scope=\&#34;col\&#34;>File here instead&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Apple Valley&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Washington County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Brian Head&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Iron County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Brigham City&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Box Elder County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Cedar City&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Iron County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Centerfield&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Sanpete County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Cottonwood Heights&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Holladay Municipal Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Enoch&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Iron County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Farmington&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Davis County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Fruit Heights&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Davis County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Glendale&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Orderville Municipal Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Hooper&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Roy Municipal Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Huntsville&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Uintah-Huntsville Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Ivins&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Santa Clara Municipal Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>La Verkin&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Hurricane Municipal Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Marriott-Slatersville&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Washington Terrace Municipal Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Mayfield&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Sanpete County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Mendon&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Nibley Municipal Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Milford&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Beaver County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Minersville&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Beaver County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Paradise&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Hyrum Municipal Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Perry&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Box Elder County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Price&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Carbon County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Rockville&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Washington County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>South Jordan&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Salt Lake County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Springdale&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Washington County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>St. George&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Washington County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Sunnyside&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Carbon County East Precinct Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Virgin&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Washington County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Wales&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Sanpete County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Weber County&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Roy Municipal Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Wendover&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Tooele County Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>West Bountiful&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>North Salt Lake Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>West Haven&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>Roy Municipal Justice Court&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;/tbody>&lt;/table>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;br>\r\nOnce you know where to file, go to step 3.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-fbac1d9934" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Small claims cases are usually filed in a justice court (except in Cache County, where there isn&#39;t a County-wide justice court. If the action or defendant are not in the jurisdiction of the remaining justice courts in Cache County, then you file in district court).  You have two options for where to file:</p>
<ul><li><p>where the defendant lives, or </p>
</li><li><p>where the events happened</p>
</li></ul>
<p><b>Are you suing a business?</b> Most businesses must register with the Department of Commerce. You can use their <a href="https://secure.utah.gov/bes/index.html">Business Search</a> to find where a business “lives.” This tells you which court to file in. You can also find out how to serve them (read more in Step 4 below). </p>
<p><b>Are you suing a skilled worker and do not know their address? </b>A skilled worker is someone like a dentist, a contractor, or a beautician. Many skilled workers must also register with the Department of Commerce. <a href="https://admin.commerce.utah.gov/programs-we-administer/who-must-register-with-the-department-of-commerce/">Find links and search for people registered in those occupations</a>.</p>
<p><b>How to find the right justice court<br />
 </b>You need to file in the right justice court. File in the:</p>
<ul><li><p>City or town justice court if they have one, and</p>
</li><li><p>County justice court, if no city or town court, and</p>
</li><li><p>District court if no county court (only Cache County has none) </p>
</li></ul>
<p>Use the <a class="rfcu-link" href="/en/about/miscellaneous/directory.html">court directory</a> to find the right justice court.</p>
<p>Some cities and counties use another city or county’s justice court. If yours does, it means there is no courthouse in your city or county, but the court still exists legally. This affects where you file. </p>
<p>Use this table to see which cities and counties share courts, and where to file.</p>
<table cellpadding="2" cellspacing="0" border="1"><tbody><tr><th> </th><th scope="col">If you would normally file in...   </th><th scope="col">File here instead</th></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Apple Valley<br />
</td><td>Washington County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Brian Head</td><td>Iron County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Brigham City</td><td>Box Elder County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Cedar City</td><td>Iron County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Centerfield</td><td>Sanpete County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Cottonwood Heights</td><td>Holladay Municipal Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Enoch</td><td>Iron County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Farmington</td><td>Davis County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Fruit Heights</td><td>Davis County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Glendale</td><td>Orderville Municipal Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Hooper</td><td>Roy Municipal Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Huntsville</td><td>Uintah-Huntsville Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Ivins</td><td>Santa Clara Municipal Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>La Verkin</td><td>Hurricane Municipal Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Marriott-Slatersville</td><td>Washington Terrace Municipal Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Mayfield</td><td>Sanpete County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Mendon</td><td>Nibley Municipal Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Milford</td><td>Beaver County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Minersville</td><td>Beaver County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Paradise</td><td>Hyrum Municipal Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Perry</td><td>Box Elder County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Price</td><td>Carbon County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Rockville</td><td>Washington County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>South Jordan</td><td>Salt Lake County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Springdale</td><td>Washington County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>St. George</td><td>Washington County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Sunnyside</td><td>Carbon County East Precinct Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Virgin</td><td>Washington County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Wales</td><td>Sanpete County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Weber County</td><td>Roy Municipal Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>Wendover</td><td>Tooele County Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>West Bountiful</td><td>North Salt Lake Justice Court</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td>West Haven</td><td>Roy Municipal Justice Court</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p><br />
Once you know where to file, go to step 3. <br />
</p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion/item_1692813911784.forms.html"/></div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-533ada815f-item-a310f53868&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-10-05T19:12:50Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Step 3 - Fill Out Forms and File &#34;}}" id="accordion-533ada815f-item-a310f53868">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-533ada815f-item-a310f53868-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-533ada815f-item-a310f53868-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Step 3 - Fill Out Forms and File ">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Step 3 - Fill Out Forms and File </span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-533ada815f-item-a310f53868-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-533ada815f-item-a310f53868-button"><div class="text">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-a310f53868&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-10-05T19:12:50Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>&lt;b>Choose the right forms&lt;/b>.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>First, figure out if your court is using Online Dispute Resolution (ODR). ODR lets you try to resolve your case on your own time using your phone or computer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;sub>&lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/urapdocs/13.pdf\&#34;>Utah Supreme Court Standing Order Number 13&lt;/a>.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/sub>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>This table lists courts using ODR.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;table cellpadding=\&#34;1\&#34; cellspacing=\&#34;0\&#34; border=\&#34;1\&#34;>\r\n&lt;tbody>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&lt;p>Alpine Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Box Elder County&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Carbon County&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Clearfiled&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Delta City&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Duchesne County&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>East Carbon&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Emery County&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Fillmore City&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Genola Justice Court&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Goshen Justice Court&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Grand County&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Heber City&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>&lt;p>Highland&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Holladay&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Iron County&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Juab County&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Lehi&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Lindon&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Millard County&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Morgan&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Murray&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Nephi City&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Orem City&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Ogden&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Payson&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Provo City&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;td>&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Salt Lake City&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Salt Lake County&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Sandy City&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Santaquin&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>South Salt Lake&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Summit County Justice Court&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Sunset&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Taylorsville&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Utah County&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Wasatch County&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Washington County&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Wellington Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>West Jordan&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>West Valley City&amp;nbsp;Justice Court&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;/tbody>&lt;/table>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>If your court is using ODR, fill out these forms&lt;/b>:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1024XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1024XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Small Claims Summons and Affidavit (Online Dispute Resolution Case) &lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/odr/docs/2001SC_Small_Claims_Affidavit_and_Summons_ODR.pdf\&#34;>PDF&lt;/a> l&amp;nbsp; &lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/odr/docs/2001SC_Small_Claims_Affidavit_and_Summons_ODR.doc\&#34;>Fillable Form&lt;/a>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>If you can’t use ODR because of a disability, no internet access, or you don’t speak English, you can ask for a trial and skip ODR. File this form along with the forms above:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;3006SC\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>3006SC&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>After filling out your forms,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html\&#34;>file them&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;with the justice court.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>If your court does NOT use ODR, fill out these forms&lt;/b>:&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span data-rte-class=\&#34;rte-temp\&#34;>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1024XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1024XX&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1025XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1025XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>After filling out your forms, &lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html\&#34;>file them&lt;/a> with the justice court. There is a filing fee (check the cover sheet for the amount). If you cannot afford the fee you can ask for a &lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.utcourts.gov/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/waiver.html\&#34; class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34;>fee waiver&lt;/a>.&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Once you have filed, go to &lt;b>step 4&lt;/b>.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-a310f53868" class="cmp-text">
    <p><b>Choose the right forms</b>.</p>
<p>First, figure out if your court is using Online Dispute Resolution (ODR). ODR lets you try to resolve your case on your own time using your phone or computer. </p>
<p><sub><a class="rfcu-link" href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/urapdocs/13.pdf">Utah Supreme Court Standing Order Number 13</a>. </sub></p>
<p>This table lists courts using ODR. </p>
<table cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0" border="1"><tbody><tr><td><p>Alpine Justice Court </p>
<p>Box Elder County Justice Court </p>
<p>Carbon County Justice Court </p>
<p>Clearfiled Justice Court </p>
<p>Delta City Justice Court </p>
<p>Duchesne County Justice Court </p>
<p>East Carbon Justice Court </p>
<p>Emery County Justice Court </p>
<p>Fillmore City Justice Court </p>
<p>Genola Justice Court</p>
<p>Goshen Justice Court</p>
<p>Grand County Justice Court </p>
<p>Heber City Justice Court </p>
</td><td><p>Highland Justice Court </p>
<p>Holladay Justice Court </p>
<p>Iron County Justice Court </p>
<p>Juab County Justice Court </p>
<p>Lehi Justice Court </p>
<p>Lindon Justice Court </p>
<p>Millard County Justice Court </p>
<p>Morgan Justice Court </p>
<p>Murray Justice Court </p>
<p>Nephi City Justice Court </p>
<p>Orem City Justice Court </p>
<p>Ogden Justice Court </p>
<p>Payson Justice Court </p>
<p>Provo City Justice Court</p>
</td><td><p> </p>
<p>Salt Lake City Justice Court </p>
<p>Salt Lake County Justice Court<br />
</p>
<p>Sandy City Justice Court </p>
<p>Santaquin Justice Court </p>
<p>South Salt Lake Justice Court </p>
<p>Summit County Justice Court</p>
<p>Sunset Justice Court </p>
<p>Taylorsville Justice Court </p>
<p>Utah County Justice Court </p>
<p>Wasatch County Justice Court </p>
<p>Washington County Justice Court </p>
<p>Wellington Justice Court </p>
<p>West Jordan Justice Court </p>
<p>West Valley City Justice Court </p>
</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p> </p>
<p><b>If your court is using ODR, fill out these forms</b>:</p>
<ul><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1024XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1024XX</span></li><li>Small Claims Summons and Affidavit (Online Dispute Resolution Case) <a class="rfcu-link" href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/odr/docs/2001SC_Small_Claims_Affidavit_and_Summons_ODR.pdf">PDF</a> l  <a class="rfcu-link" href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/odr/docs/2001SC_Small_Claims_Affidavit_and_Summons_ODR.doc">Fillable Form</a></li></ul>
<p>If you can’t use ODR because of a disability, no internet access, or you don’t speak English, you can ask for a trial and skip ODR. File this form along with the forms above:</p>
<ul><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="3006SC" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">3006SC</span></li></ul>
<p>After filling out your forms, <a href="/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html">file them</a> with the justice court.</p>
<p> </p>
<p><b>If your court does NOT use ODR, fill out these forms</b>:<br />
</p>
<ul><li><span data-rte-class="rte-temp"><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1024XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1024XX</span></span></li><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1025XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1025XX</span></li></ul>
<p>After filling out your forms, <a class="rfcu-link" href="/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html">file them</a> with the justice court. There is a filing fee (check the cover sheet for the amount). If you cannot afford the fee you can ask for a <a href="https://www.utcourts.gov/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/waiver.html" class="rfcu-link">fee waiver</a>.<br />
</p>
<p>Once you have filed, go to <b>step 4</b>.</p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion/item_1692813914173.forms.html"/></div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-533ada815f-item-1d72d52575&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:59:23Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Step 4 - Serve the Papers&#34;}}" id="accordion-533ada815f-item-1d72d52575">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-533ada815f-item-1d72d52575-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-533ada815f-item-1d72d52575-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Step 4 - Serve the Papers">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Step 4 - Serve the Papers</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-533ada815f-item-1d72d52575-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-533ada815f-item-1d72d52575-button"><div class="text">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-1d72d52575&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:59:23Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>When you file your papers, the clerk will process them and then give them back to you with a case number. You must &lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/service/service-of-process.html\&#34;>have the papers served on the defendant&lt;/a>. Keep a copy of everything you serve for your records.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If your case is not using ODR, you must have the defendant served at least 30 days before the trial.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>For cases using ODR, you must have the defendant served within 120 days of filing the case.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;sub>&lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type=srpe&amp;amp;rule=3\&#34;>Rule of Small Claims Procedure 3&lt;/a>.&lt;/sub>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Once you have had the papers served, &lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html\&#34;>file&lt;/a> proof of service with the court. Then go to&lt;b> next steps&lt;/b>.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-1d72d52575" class="cmp-text">
    <p>When you file your papers, the clerk will process them and then give them back to you with a case number. You must <a class="rfcu-link" href="/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/service/service-of-process.html">have the papers served on the defendant</a>. Keep a copy of everything you serve for your records.</p>
<p>If your case is not using ODR, you must have the defendant served at least 30 days before the trial.</p>
<p>For cases using ODR, you must have the defendant served within 120 days of filing the case. </p>
<p><sub><a class="rfcu-link" href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type&#61;srpe&amp;rule&#61;3">Rule of Small Claims Procedure 3</a>.</sub></p>
<p>Once you have had the papers served, <a class="rfcu-link" href="/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html">file</a> proof of service with the court. Then go to<b> next steps</b>. </p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion/item_1692813923385.forms.html"/></div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-533ada815f-item-ef82f5d316&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-02-10T19:21:39Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Next Steps&#34;}}" id="accordion-533ada815f-item-ef82f5d316">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-533ada815f-item-ef82f5d316-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-533ada815f-item-ef82f5d316-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Next Steps">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Next Steps</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-533ada815f-item-ef82f5d316-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-533ada815f-item-ef82f5d316-button"><div class="accordion panelcontainer"><div id="accordion-ef82f5d316" class="cmp-accordion " data-cmp-is="accordion" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-ef82f5d316&#34;:{&#34;shownItems&#34;:[],&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-02-10T19:21:39Z&#34;}}" data-placeholder-text="false">
    <div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-ef82f5d316-item-3a0394ac10&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;For ODR Cases&#34;}}" id="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-3a0394ac10">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-3a0394ac10-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-3a0394ac10-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="For ODR Cases">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">For ODR Cases</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-3a0394ac10-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-3a0394ac10-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">
    
    <div id="container-3a0394ac10" class="cmp-container" style="background-color:rgba(127,127,127,0.17);">
        <div class="cmp-container-inner">
            


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="accordion panelcontainer aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><div id="accordion-7e78c9b73b" class="cmp-accordion " data-cmp-is="accordion" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-7e78c9b73b&#34;:{&#34;shownItems&#34;:[],&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-02-12T22:10:54Z&#34;}}" data-placeholder-text="false">
    <div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-901394f617&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Log into the ODR system within 7 days of filing your case&#34;}}" id="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-901394f617">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-901394f617-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-901394f617-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Log into the ODR system within 7 days of filing your case">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Log into the ODR system within 7 days of filing your case</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-901394f617-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-901394f617-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">
    
    <div id="container-901394f617" class="cmp-container" style="background-color:rgba(127,127,127,0.17);">
        <div class="cmp-container-inner">
            


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-02581e858a&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:58:58Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Check your email to log into the ODR system.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>The court will email you a password for ODR and a link.&amp;nbsp;They will use the email on your affidavit and summons. Follow the instructions in the email.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Look for an email from&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;mailto:courtsystems@utcourts.gov\&#34; style=\&#34;font-size: 14.0px;\&#34;>courtsystems@utcourts.gov&lt;/a>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Check your spam folder if you do not receive an email&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Be sure to log in within&amp;nbsp;7 days&amp;nbsp;of filing or your case will be dismissed&lt;/b>.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>After you log in, wait. The defendant has 14 days after being served to log in. The day they were served is day 0 and the next day is day 1.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Having trouble logging in?&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>If the link in your email does not work, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;https://apps.utcourts.gov/OnlineDisputeResolutionWEB/ODRServlet\&#34; class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34;>odr.utcourts.gov&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;and click “Login”&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>If you did not receive your password, click “Forgot/Reset password?” The system will email you a new password. Your old password will not work&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Be patient! It could take a few minutes for your email to arrive. If you reset your password multiple times, you might get mixed up about which one to use. If that happens, wait a bit and then use the password from the latest email&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;sub>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/urapdocs/13.pdf\&#34;>Utah Supreme Court Standing Order Number 13&lt;/a>(2)(d) and (4)(a)&lt;/sub>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-02581e858a" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Check your email to log into the ODR system. </p>
<p>The court will email you a password for ODR and a link. They will use the email on your affidavit and summons. Follow the instructions in the email.</p>
<ul><li>Look for an email from <a href="mailto:courtsystems&#64;utcourts.gov" style="	font-size: 14.0px;
">courtsystems&#64;utcourts.gov</a></li><li>Check your spam folder if you do not receive an email</li></ul>
<p><b>Be sure to log in within 7 days of filing or your case will be dismissed</b>.</p>
<p>After you log in, wait. The defendant has 14 days after being served to log in. The day they were served is day 0 and the next day is day 1. </p>
<p><b>Having trouble logging in?</b></p>
<ul><li>If the link in your email does not work, visit <a href="https://apps.utcourts.gov/OnlineDisputeResolutionWEB/ODRServlet" class="rfcu-link">odr.utcourts.gov</a> and click “Login”</li><li>If you did not receive your password, click “Forgot/Reset password?” The system will email you a new password. Your old password will not work</li><li>Be patient! It could take a few minutes for your email to arrive. If you reset your password multiple times, you might get mixed up about which one to use. If that happens, wait a bit and then use the password from the latest email</li></ul>
<p><sub><a href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/urapdocs/13.pdf">Utah Supreme Court Standing Order Number 13</a>(2)(d) and (4)(a)</sub></p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion/item_1692823183314/item_1739214584336/accordion/item_1739214801514/text.forms.html"/></div>

    
</div>

        </div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-f17e87c22d&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;After the defendant logs in&#34;}}" id="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-f17e87c22d">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-f17e87c22d-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-f17e87c22d-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="After the defendant logs in">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">After the defendant logs in</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-f17e87c22d-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-f17e87c22d-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">
    
    <div id="container-f17e87c22d" class="cmp-container" style="background-color:rgba(127,127,127,0.17);">
        <div class="cmp-container-inner">
            


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-30d206f4f0&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:58:33Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;div>A neutral court helper called a facilitator will talk to both of you. They are not on anyone&#39;s side. They will help you resolve your case, but they are not a judge and cannot decide who will win. They can explain things but cannot predict outcomes or decide legal issues.&lt;/div>\r\n&lt;div>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div>\r\n&lt;div>Everyone will chat online. Even if you are logged out, you will receive an email or text when there are new messages.&lt;/div>\r\n&lt;div>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div>\r\n&lt;h6>&lt;b>The facilitator&#39;s job is to:&lt;/b>&lt;/h6>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Guide:&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;help everyone use ODR and try to settle&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Inform:&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;give details about the process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Ask:&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;pose questions about proof to help everyone understand the issues&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Manage time:&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;there is a 14 day deadline to settle but they can&amp;nbsp;extend the limit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Give voice and check understanding:&lt;/b> make sure everyone has a chance to talk and understands any agreement that is reached&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Communicate privately:&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;talk privately with anyone to help find a solution&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Finalize agreement or send to trial:&lt;/b> send a final agreement to the court or send the case to be set for a trial&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;sub>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/urapdocs/13.pdf\&#34;>Utah Supreme Court Standing Order Number 13&lt;/a>(6)&lt;/sub>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-30d206f4f0" class="cmp-text">
    <div>A neutral court helper called a facilitator will talk to both of you. They are not on anyone&#39;s side. They will help you resolve your case, but they are not a judge and cannot decide who will win. They can explain things but cannot predict outcomes or decide legal issues.</div>
<div> </div>
<div>Everyone will chat online. Even if you are logged out, you will receive an email or text when there are new messages.</div>
<div> </div>
<h6><b>The facilitator&#39;s job is to:</b></h6>
<ul><li><b>Guide:</b> help everyone use ODR and try to settle</li><li><b>Inform:</b> give details about the process </li><li><b>Ask:</b> pose questions about proof to help everyone understand the issues</li><li><b>Manage time:</b> there is a 14 day deadline to settle but they can extend the limit </li><li><b>Give voice and check understanding:</b> make sure everyone has a chance to talk and understands any agreement that is reached</li><li><b>Communicate privately:</b> talk privately with anyone to help find a solution</li><li><b>Finalize agreement or send to trial:</b> send a final agreement to the court or send the case to be set for a trial</li></ul>
<p><sub><a href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/urapdocs/13.pdf">Utah Supreme Court Standing Order Number 13</a>(6)</sub></p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion/item_1692823183314/item_1739214584336/accordion/item_1739214804369/text.forms.html"/></div>

    
</div>

        </div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-7f80f1c5a8&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Sharing your proof in ODR&#34;}}" id="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-7f80f1c5a8">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-7f80f1c5a8-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-7f80f1c5a8-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Sharing your proof in ODR">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Sharing your proof in ODR</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-7f80f1c5a8-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-7f80f1c5a8-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">
    
    <div id="container-7f80f1c5a8" class="cmp-container" style="background-color:rgba(127,127,127,0.17);">
        <div class="cmp-container-inner">
            


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-b33959d506&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:58:19Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Check your file:&lt;/b>&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Make sure your proof is saved as a picture or a PDF&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Supported file types are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=\&#34;font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Regular&amp;quot; , sans-serif;\&#34;>PDF&lt;/b> (documents),&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=\&#34;font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Regular&amp;quot; , sans-serif;\&#34;>JPG, JPEG, PNG, GIF&lt;/b> (pictures)&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>If your file is not one of these types, you might need to convert it or get help&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b style=\&#34;font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Regular&amp;quot; , sans-serif;\&#34;>Find the paperclip button&amp;nbsp;&lt;b data-rte-class=\&#34;rte-temp\&#34;>&lt;span class=\&#34;custom-icon-wrapper\&#34;>&lt;b data-rte-class=\&#34;rte-temp\&#34;>&lt;span class=\&#34;filler-icon-prefix\&#34;>1&lt;/span>&lt;/b>&lt;svg class=\&#34;svg-inline--fa fa-paperclip\&#34; data-prefix=\&#34;fal\&#34; data-icon=\&#34;paperclip\&#34; role=\&#34;img\&#34; xmlns=\&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\&#34; viewbox=\&#34;0 0 448 512\&#34;>&lt;path fill=\&#34;currentColor\&#34; d=\&#34;M380.7 67.3c-29.1-29.1-76.3-29.1-105.4 0l-192 192c-46.8 46.8-46.8 122.6 0 169.4s122.6 46.8 169.4 0l152-152c6.2-6.2 16.4-6.2 22.6 0s6.2 16.4 0 22.6l-152 152c-59.3 59.3-155.4 59.3-214.6 0S1.4 296 60.7 236.7l192-192c41.6-41.6 109-41.6 150.6 0s41.6 109 0 150.6L219.5 379.1c-28.2 28.2-74.6 25.6-99.6-5.5c-21.3-26.6-19.2-65 4.9-89.1L276.7 132.7c6.2-6.2 16.4-6.2 22.6 0s6.2 16.4 0 22.6L147.5 307.1c-12.6 12.6-13.7 32.6-2.6 46.5c13 16.2 37.2 17.6 51.9 2.9L380.7 172.7c29.1-29.1 29.1-76.3 0-105.4z\&#34;>&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>&lt;b data-rte-class=\&#34;rte-temp\&#34;>&lt;span class=\&#34;filler-icon-prefix\&#34;>1&lt;/span>&lt;/b>&lt;/span>&lt;/b>&lt;/b>&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Look to the left of the chat window and tap the button&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b style=\&#34;font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Regular&amp;quot; , sans-serif;\&#34;>Select your file:&lt;/b>&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>A window will open - choose the document type and title&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Tap the file you want to share&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b style=\&#34;font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Regular&amp;quot; , sans-serif;\&#34;>Attach the file:&lt;/b>&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>If your file type is supported, you will see an &lt;b style=\&#34;font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Regular&amp;quot; , sans-serif;\&#34;>&amp;quot;Attach&amp;quot;&lt;/b> button&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span style=\&#34;font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Regular&amp;quot; , sans-serif;\&#34;>Tap&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>&lt;b style=\&#34;font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Regular&amp;quot; , sans-serif;\&#34;>&amp;quot;Attach&amp;quot;&lt;/b> to add your file to the chat&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b style=\&#34;font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Regular&amp;quot; , sans-serif;\&#34;>Confirm sharing:&lt;/b>&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Your file will appear in the chat and everyone will see it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&lt;h6>&lt;b>Important Notes:&lt;/b>&lt;/h6>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>What you upload to ODR is &lt;b>not&lt;/b> part of your court case - it cannot be used in court without your permission&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Keep Copies of Your Proof&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>If you do not settle and need the court to see your proof, you will have to show it at trial&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;sub>&lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;https://le.utah.gov/xcode/Title78B/Chapter6/78B-6-S208.html\&#34;>Utah Code 78B-6-208&lt;/a>(2) and (3)&lt;/sub>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-b33959d506" class="cmp-text">
    <ol><li><b>Check your file:</b><ul><li>Make sure your proof is saved as a picture or a PDF</li><li>Supported file types are: <b style="	font-family: &#34;Roboto Regular&#34; , sans-serif;
">PDF</b> (documents), <b style="	font-family: &#34;Roboto Regular&#34; , sans-serif;
">JPG, JPEG, PNG, GIF</b> (pictures)</li><li>If your file is not one of these types, you might need to convert it or get help</li></ul>
</li><li><b style="	font-family: &#34;Roboto Regular&#34; , sans-serif;
">Find the paperclip button <b data-rte-class="rte-temp"><span class="custom-icon-wrapper"><b data-rte-class="rte-temp"><span class="filler-icon-prefix">1</span></b><svg class="svg-inline--fa fa-paperclip" data-prefix="fal" data-icon="paperclip" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M380.7 67.3c-29.1-29.1-76.3-29.1-105.4 0l-192 192c-46.8 46.8-46.8 122.6 0 169.4s122.6 46.8 169.4 0l152-152c6.2-6.2 16.4-6.2 22.6 0s6.2 16.4 0 22.6l-152 152c-59.3 59.3-155.4 59.3-214.6 0S1.4 296 60.7 236.7l192-192c41.6-41.6 109-41.6 150.6 0s41.6 109 0 150.6L219.5 379.1c-28.2 28.2-74.6 25.6-99.6-5.5c-21.3-26.6-19.2-65 4.9-89.1L276.7 132.7c6.2-6.2 16.4-6.2 22.6 0s6.2 16.4 0 22.6L147.5 307.1c-12.6 12.6-13.7 32.6-2.6 46.5c13 16.2 37.2 17.6 51.9 2.9L380.7 172.7c29.1-29.1 29.1-76.3 0-105.4z"></path></svg><b data-rte-class="rte-temp"><span class="filler-icon-prefix">1</span></b></span></b></b><ul><li>Look to the left of the chat window and tap the button</li></ul>
</li><li><b style="	font-family: &#34;Roboto Regular&#34; , sans-serif;
">Select your file:</b><ul><li>A window will open - choose the document type and title</li><li>Tap the file you want to share</li></ul>
</li><li><b style="	font-family: &#34;Roboto Regular&#34; , sans-serif;
">Attach the file:</b><ul><li>If your file type is supported, you will see an <b style="	font-family: &#34;Roboto Regular&#34; , sans-serif;
">&#34;Attach&#34;</b> button</li><li><span style="	font-family: &#34;Roboto Regular&#34; , sans-serif;
">Tap </span><b style="	font-family: &#34;Roboto Regular&#34; , sans-serif;
">&#34;Attach&#34;</b> to add your file to the chat</li></ul>
</li><li><b style="	font-family: &#34;Roboto Regular&#34; , sans-serif;
">Confirm sharing:</b><ul><li>Your file will appear in the chat and everyone will see it </li></ul>
</li></ol>
<h6><b>Important Notes:</b></h6>
<ul><li>What you upload to ODR is <b>not</b> part of your court case - it cannot be used in court without your permission</li><li>Keep Copies of Your Proof<ul><li>If you do not settle and need the court to see your proof, you will have to show it at trial</li></ul>
</li></ul>
<p><sub><a class="rfcu-link" href="https://le.utah.gov/xcode/Title78B/Chapter6/78B-6-S208.html">Utah Code 78B-6-208</a>(2) and (3)</sub></p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion/item_1692823183314/item_1739214584336/accordion/item_1739398244019/text_copy_copy_copy.forms.html"/></div>

    
</div>

        </div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-5d21781b1a&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Mediation instead of ODR&#34;}}" id="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-5d21781b1a">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-5d21781b1a-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-5d21781b1a-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Mediation instead of ODR">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Mediation instead of ODR</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-5d21781b1a-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-5d21781b1a-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">
    
    <div id="container-5d21781b1a" class="cmp-container" style="background-color:rgba(127,127,127,0.17);">
        <div class="cmp-container-inner">
            


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-0a8fe6d12b&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-02-12T22:44:38Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Your facilitator might ask if you want to mediate instead of using ODR. In mediation:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>A mediator (like a facilitator) helps you talk about your case and reach an agreement&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>You join a video call where everyone is online at the same time&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>You talk instead of sending chat messages&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>You might talk with everyone or just with the mediator, based on what is most helpful&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>Mediation can be helpful if you have a long history with the defendant.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Key Points:&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Everyone must agree to mediate&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>The mediator will schedule the time and send a link for the video call&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Make sure you have a strong internet connection and enough battery on your phone or computer&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-0a8fe6d12b" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Your facilitator might ask if you want to mediate instead of using ODR. In mediation:</p>
<ul><li>A mediator (like a facilitator) helps you talk about your case and reach an agreement</li><li>You join a video call where everyone is online at the same time</li><li>You talk instead of sending chat messages</li><li>You might talk with everyone or just with the mediator, based on what is most helpful</li></ul>
<p>Mediation can be helpful if you have a long history with the defendant.</p>
<p><b>Key Points:</b></p>
<ul><li>Everyone must agree to mediate</li><li>The mediator will schedule the time and send a link for the video call</li><li>Make sure you have a strong internet connection and enough battery on your phone or computer</li></ul>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion/item_1692823183314/item_1739214584336/accordion/item_1739214827257/text.forms.html"/></div>

    
</div>

        </div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-1ecef85ec3&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;If the defendant does not join&#34;}}" id="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-1ecef85ec3">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-1ecef85ec3-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-1ecef85ec3-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="If the defendant does not join">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">If the defendant does not join</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-1ecef85ec3-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-1ecef85ec3-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">
    
    <div id="container-1ecef85ec3" class="cmp-container" style="background-color:rgba(127,127,127,0.17);">
        <div class="cmp-container-inner">
            


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-0fdc53f8d9&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-04-03T15:29:56Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>If the defendant does not register for ODR within 14 days, you can ask for a default judgment. This means asking the court to rule in your favor based on your Affidavit. Use these forms:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1352GE\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1352GE&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;2011SC\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>2011SC&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;2012SC\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>2012SC&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/urapdocs/13.pdf\&#34;>&lt;sub>Utah Supreme Court Standing Order No. 13&lt;/sub>&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-0fdc53f8d9" class="cmp-text">
    <p>If the defendant does not register for ODR within 14 days, you can ask for a default judgment. This means asking the court to rule in your favor based on your Affidavit. Use these forms:</p>
<ul><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1352GE" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1352GE</span></li><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="2011SC" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">2011SC</span></li><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="2012SC" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">2012SC</span></li></ul>
<p><a class="rfcu-link" href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/urapdocs/13.pdf"><sub>Utah Supreme Court Standing Order No. 13</sub></a></p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion/item_1692823183314/item_1739214584336/accordion/item_1739214820389/text.forms.html"/></div>

    
</div>

        </div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-403792f0b9&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;If your case does not settle&#34;}}" id="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-403792f0b9">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-403792f0b9-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-403792f0b9-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="If your case does not settle">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">If your case does not settle</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-403792f0b9-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-7e78c9b73b-item-403792f0b9-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">
    
    <div id="container-403792f0b9" class="cmp-container" style="background-color:rgba(127,127,127,0.17);">
        <div class="cmp-container-inner">
            


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-0480498fa5&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:57:47Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>If you and the other side cannot agree, your case will go to trial in about 7-21 days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;b>Be sure to attend your trial, or you will lose your case automatically.&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>At the trial,&lt;b>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b>bring any proof that helps your case, like photos, receipts, messages, or witnesses. The judge will look at everything you bring and decide whether it can be used.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Do your best to get ready for your trial ahead of time. This will be your only chance to convince the judge that you should win. Read about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/pro-se.html\&#34;>Going to Court&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;to help you get ready.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Do you need to change your trial date?&lt;/b>&lt;br>\r\nYou can ask for a different date if you have a good reason. File these papers:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span data-rte-class=\&#34;rte-temp\&#34;>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1037XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1037XX&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span data-rte-class=\&#34;rte-temp\&#34;>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1038XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1038XX&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>If the court grants your request, they will tell the other party.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type=srpe&amp;amp;rule=6\&#34;>&lt;/a>&lt;sub>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/urapdocs/13.pdf\&#34;>Utah Supreme Court Standing Order Number 13&lt;/a>(8). &lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type=srpe&amp;amp;rule=6\&#34;>Rule of Small Claims Procedure 6&lt;/a>&lt;/sub>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-0480498fa5" class="cmp-text">
    <p>If you and the other side cannot agree, your case will go to trial in about 7-21 days. <b>Be sure to attend your trial, or you will lose your case automatically.</b>  </p>
<p>At the trial,<b> </b>bring any proof that helps your case, like photos, receipts, messages, or witnesses. The judge will look at everything you bring and decide whether it can be used.</p>
<p>Do your best to get ready for your trial ahead of time. This will be your only chance to convince the judge that you should win. Read about <a href="/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/pro-se.html">Going to Court</a> to help you get ready.</p>
<p><b>Do you need to change your trial date?</b><br />
You can ask for a different date if you have a good reason. File these papers:</p>
<ul><li><span data-rte-class="rte-temp"><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1037XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1037XX</span></span></li><li><span data-rte-class="rte-temp"><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1038XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1038XX</span></span></li></ul>
<p>If the court grants your request, they will tell the other party. <br />
</p>
<p><a class="rfcu-link" href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type&#61;srpe&amp;rule&#61;6"></a><sub><a href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/urapdocs/13.pdf">Utah Supreme Court Standing Order Number 13</a>(8). <a class="rfcu-link" href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type&#61;srpe&amp;rule&#61;6">Rule of Small Claims Procedure 6</a></sub></p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion/item_1692823183314/item_1739214584336/accordion/item_1739214829649/text_copy_copy.forms.html"/></div>

    
</div>

        </div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>

    
</div>

        </div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-ef82f5d316-item-04ff9ad855&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:57:32Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;For Non-ODR Cases&#34;}}" id="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-04ff9ad855">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-04ff9ad855-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-04ff9ad855-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="For Non-ODR Cases">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">For Non-ODR Cases</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-04ff9ad855-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-04ff9ad855-button"><div class="text">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-04ff9ad855&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:57:32Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>When you file, your case will be scheduled for a trial. &lt;b>Be sure to attend or you will lose your case automatically.&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>At the trial,&amp;nbsp;bring any proof that helps your case, like photos, receipts, messages, or witnesses. The judge will look at everything you bring and decide whether it can be used.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Do your best to get ready for your trial ahead of time. This will be your only chance to convince the judge that you should win. Read about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/pro-se.html\&#34;>Going to Court&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;to help you get ready.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Do you need to change your trial date?&lt;br>\r\n &lt;/b>You can ask to change the trial date if you have a good reason. File these papers:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Motion to Postpone Small Claims Case&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;https://apps.utcourts.gov/InterviewAPI/aem/forms/template/1317\&#34;>PDF Form&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/howto/smallclaims/docs/07_Motion_to_Postpone.doc\&#34;>Fillable Form&lt;/a>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Order on Motion to Postpone Small Claims Case&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;https://apps.utcourts.gov/InterviewAPI/aem/forms/template/1318\&#34;>PDF Form&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/howto/smallclaims/docs/08_Order_on_Motion_to_Postpone.doc\&#34;>Fillable Form&lt;/a>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>If the court grants your request, they will tell the other party.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type=srpe&amp;amp;rule=6\&#34;>&lt;sub>Rule of Small Claims Procedure 6&lt;/sub>&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-04ff9ad855" class="cmp-text">
    <p>When you file, your case will be scheduled for a trial. <b>Be sure to attend or you will lose your case automatically.</b></p>
<p>At the trial, bring any proof that helps your case, like photos, receipts, messages, or witnesses. The judge will look at everything you bring and decide whether it can be used.</p>
<p>Do your best to get ready for your trial ahead of time. This will be your only chance to convince the judge that you should win. Read about <a href="/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/pro-se.html">Going to Court</a> to help you get ready.</p>
<p><b>Do you need to change your trial date?<br />
 </b>You can ask to change the trial date if you have a good reason. File these papers:</p>
<ul><li>Motion to Postpone Small Claims Case <a href="https://apps.utcourts.gov/InterviewAPI/aem/forms/template/1317">PDF Form</a> | <a href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/howto/smallclaims/docs/07_Motion_to_Postpone.doc">Fillable Form</a></li><li>Order on Motion to Postpone Small Claims Case <a href="https://apps.utcourts.gov/InterviewAPI/aem/forms/template/1318">PDF Form</a> | <a href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/howto/smallclaims/docs/08_Order_on_Motion_to_Postpone.doc">Fillable Form</a></li></ul>
<p>If the court grants your request, they will tell the other party. <br />
</p>
<p><a href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type&#61;srpe&amp;rule&#61;6"><sub>Rule of Small Claims Procedure 6</sub></a></p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion/item_1692823183314/item_1692823211616.forms.html"/></div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-ef82f5d316-item-c834dbaad1&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-11-13T22:53:53Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Enforcing a Settlement Agreement&#34;}}" id="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-c834dbaad1">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-c834dbaad1-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-c834dbaad1-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Enforcing a Settlement Agreement">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Enforcing a Settlement Agreement</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-c834dbaad1-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-c834dbaad1-button"><div class="text">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-c834dbaad1&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-11-13T22:53:53Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>If you came to an agreement either in ODR or before your trial, you can ask for help from the court in enforcing your settlement. Follow these steps.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Step 1 - file these forms&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html\&#34;>File your papers&lt;/a> with the justice court where your case was originally filed.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1033XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1033XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1034XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1034XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Step 2 - serve the other party&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;https://www.utcourts.gov/en/legal-help/legal-help/procedures/service/service-of-process.html#Papers\&#34;>Serve the other party&lt;/a> with the papers you file.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Step 3 - attend the hearing&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>When you file, the court will schedule a hearing. Be sure to attend.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If the court rules in your favor, you might get a judgment. Read about &lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/judgment.html\&#34;>How to Collect a Judgment&lt;/a>.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-c834dbaad1" class="cmp-text">
    <p>If you came to an agreement either in ODR or before your trial, you can ask for help from the court in enforcing your settlement. Follow these steps.</p>
<p><b>Step 1 - file these forms</b></p>
<p><a class="rfcu-link" href="/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html">File your papers</a> with the justice court where your case was originally filed.</p>
<ul><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1033XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1033XX</span></li><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1034XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1034XX</span></li></ul>
<p><b>Step 2 - serve the other party</b></p>
<p><a class="rfcu-link" href="https://www.utcourts.gov/en/legal-help/legal-help/procedures/service/service-of-process.html#Papers">Serve the other party</a> with the papers you file.</p>
<p><b>Step 3 - attend the hearing</b></p>
<p>When you file, the court will schedule a hearing. Be sure to attend.</p>
<p>If the court rules in your favor, you might get a judgment. Read about <a class="rfcu-link" href="/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/judgment.html">How to Collect a Judgment</a>. </p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion/item_1692823183314/item_1699907183316.forms.html"/></div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-ef82f5d316-item-c21809c879&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:57:16Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;After trial&#34;}}" id="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-c21809c879">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-c21809c879-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-c21809c879-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="After trial">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">After trial</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-c21809c879-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-c21809c879-button"><div class="text">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-c21809c879&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:57:16Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>If you go to trial the judge will usually decide who wins immediatly. If not, they have 60 days to tell you what they decide.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If you win, the defendant has to pay you. If they do not, see our page on &lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/judgment.html\&#34;>How to Collect a Judgment&lt;/a>.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If you lose and think the judge made a mistake in your case, you can file an appeal. You must do this within &lt;b>28 days &lt;/b>of the judgment. Fill out these forms:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1044XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1044XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1045XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1045XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>Then &lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html\&#34;>file the forms&lt;/a> with the court that issued the judgment. The court will charge fees for the appeal.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>The court will send your paperwork to the nearest district court within the &lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/about/miscellaneous/directory/map-of-judicial-districts.html\&#34;>same judicial district&lt;/a>. The district court will schedule a trial. What happened in the first trial will not control what happens in the new trial. Bring all of your evidence and be prepared to explain why you should win.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If you win, the judge might tell you to prepare the order. Use this form:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1040XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1040XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;sub>&lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type=srpe&amp;amp;rule=12\&#34;>Utah Rule of Small Claims Procedure 12&lt;/a>.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/sub>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-c21809c879" class="cmp-text">
    <p>If you go to trial the judge will usually decide who wins immediatly. If not, they have 60 days to tell you what they decide.</p>
<p>If you win, the defendant has to pay you. If they do not, see our page on <a class="rfcu-link" href="/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/judgment.html">How to Collect a Judgment</a>. </p>
<p>If you lose and think the judge made a mistake in your case, you can file an appeal. You must do this within <b>28 days </b>of the judgment. Fill out these forms:</p>
<ul><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1044XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1044XX</span></li><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1045XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1045XX</span></li></ul>
<p>Then <a class="rfcu-link" href="/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html">file the forms</a> with the court that issued the judgment. The court will charge fees for the appeal.  </p>
<p>The court will send your paperwork to the nearest district court within the <a class="rfcu-link" href="/en/about/miscellaneous/directory/map-of-judicial-districts.html">same judicial district</a>. The district court will schedule a trial. What happened in the first trial will not control what happens in the new trial. Bring all of your evidence and be prepared to explain why you should win. </p>
<p>If you win, the judge might tell you to prepare the order. Use this form:</p>
<ul><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1040XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1040XX</span></li></ul>
<p><sub><a class="rfcu-link" href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type&#61;srpe&amp;rule&#61;12">Utah Rule of Small Claims Procedure 12</a>. </sub></p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion/item_1692823183314/item_1695412123368.forms.html"/></div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-ef82f5d316-item-88628b5063&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-11-13T23:56:00Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Did you miss your trial?&#34;}}" id="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-88628b5063">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-88628b5063-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-88628b5063-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Did you miss your trial?">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Did you miss your trial?</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-88628b5063-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-ef82f5d316-item-88628b5063-button"><div class="text">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-88628b5063&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-11-13T23:56:00Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>If you miss your trial, your case could be dismissed.&amp;nbsp;If the other side filed a counterclaim, a judgment may be entered against you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>You can ask to undo the judgment or dismissal. You must ask within 15 days after the judgment or dismissal was entered. If it has been more than 15 days, you must explain your delay.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>File these forms to ask the court to undo the dismissal or judgment:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1042XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1042XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1043XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1043XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>The court will schedule a hearing. Make sure you attend.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-88628b5063" class="cmp-text">
    <p>If you miss your trial, your case could be dismissed. If the other side filed a counterclaim, a judgment may be entered against you. </p>
<p>You can ask to undo the judgment or dismissal. You must ask within 15 days after the judgment or dismissal was entered. If it has been more than 15 days, you must explain your delay. </p>
<p>File these forms to ask the court to undo the dismissal or judgment:</p>
<ul><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1042XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1042XX</span></li><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1043XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1043XX</span></li></ul>
<p>The court will schedule a hearing. Make sure you attend. </p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion/item_1692823183314/item_1699906601566.forms.html"/></div>
</div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
<div class="filler aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><!-- START : Filler Component -->

	<div class="filler" style="padding: 35px 0;"></div>



    

<!-- END : Filler Component -->
	</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-0311483e49&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-08-25T20:21:39Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;h1>&lt;a id=\&#34;defendant\&#34;>&lt;/a>Information for People Being Sued (Defendants)&lt;/h1>\r\n&lt;p>If you received an Affidavit and Summons for a small claims case, read it carefully to know what to do. What does your summons say?&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-0311483e49" class="cmp-text">
    <h1><a id="defendant"></a>Information for People Being Sued (Defendants)</h1>
<p>If you received an Affidavit and Summons for a small claims case, read it carefully to know what to do. What does your summons say?</p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/text_318509126.forms.html"/></div>
<div class="accordion panelcontainer aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><div id="accordion-1ea2ce176a" class="cmp-accordion " data-cmp-is="accordion" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-1ea2ce176a&#34;:{&#34;shownItems&#34;:[],&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-02-12T22:38:04Z&#34;}}" data-placeholder-text="false">
    <div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-4a0b289f06&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;It says to register for ODR&#34;}}" id="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-4a0b289f06">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-4a0b289f06-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-4a0b289f06-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="It says to register for ODR">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">It says to register for ODR</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-4a0b289f06-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-4a0b289f06-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">
    
    <div id="container-4a0b289f06" class="cmp-container" style="background-color:rgba(127,127,127,0.17);">
        <div class="cmp-container-inner">
            


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-46d7daac69&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T23:03:53Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;h3>Follow the 3 steps below to register for ODR&lt;/h3>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-46d7daac69" class="cmp-text">
    <h3>Follow the 3 steps below to register for ODR</h3>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion_1915114442/item_1739399065748/text_659416548.forms.html"/></div>
<div class="accordion panelcontainer aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><div id="accordion-810a9f1dab" class="cmp-accordion " data-cmp-is="accordion" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-810a9f1dab&#34;:{&#34;shownItems&#34;:[],&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T23:09:45Z&#34;}}" data-placeholder-text="false">
    <div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-810a9f1dab-item-c49d336531&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Step 1 - Register within 14 days of receiving the affidavit and summons&#34;}}" id="accordion-810a9f1dab-item-c49d336531">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-810a9f1dab-item-c49d336531-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-810a9f1dab-item-c49d336531-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Step 1 - Register within 14 days of receiving the affidavit and summons">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Step 1 - Register within 14 days of receiving the affidavit and summons</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-810a9f1dab-item-c49d336531-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-810a9f1dab-item-c49d336531-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">
    
    <div id="container-c49d336531" class="cmp-container" style="background-color:rgba(127,127,127,0.17);">
        <div class="cmp-container-inner">
            


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-0a439980ff&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:57:01Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>ODR means Online Dispute Resolution.&amp;nbsp;ODR lets you try to resolve your case on your own time using your phone or computer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>You must register within&amp;nbsp;14 days&amp;nbsp;or you will lose automatically&lt;/b>.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>Vist&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;https://apps.utcourts.gov/OnlineDisputeResolutionWEB/ODRServlet\&#34;>odr.utcourts.gov&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Tap &amp;quot;Get Started&amp;quot;&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Follow the step-by-step instructions&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Having problems registering?&lt;/b>&lt;br>\r\nDouble check these issues:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Did you type your name correctly? Type it EXACTLY as it appears on the summons, even if it is spelled wrong&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Did you type your case number correctly? The numbers can be tricky, make sure you type it exactly as it appears on your summons&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Did you choose the correct court location? Look carefully at your summons&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>there is a different justice court for Salt Lake &lt;i>City &lt;/i>and Salt Lake &lt;i>County&lt;/i>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>If you still have problems, email&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;mailto:odr@utcourts.gov\&#34;>odr@utcourts.gov&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Do you have a disability, no internet, or trouble understanding English?&lt;/b>&lt;br>\r\nYou can ask the court to be excused from ODR. File this form:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;3006SC\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>3006SC - Request to be Excused from Online Dispute Resolution and Order on Request&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>After you log in, read below to get more guidance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/urapdocs/13.pdf\&#34;>&lt;sub>Utah Supreme Court Standing Order Number 13&lt;/sub>&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-0a439980ff" class="cmp-text">
    <p>ODR means Online Dispute Resolution. ODR lets you try to resolve your case on your own time using your phone or computer. </p>
<p><b>You must register within 14 days or you will lose automatically</b>.</p>
<ol><li>Vist <a href="https://apps.utcourts.gov/OnlineDisputeResolutionWEB/ODRServlet">odr.utcourts.gov</a>  </li><li>Tap &#34;Get Started&#34;</li><li>Follow the step-by-step instructions</li></ol>
<p><b>Having problems registering?</b><br />
Double check these issues:</p>
<ul><li>Did you type your name correctly? Type it EXACTLY as it appears on the summons, even if it is spelled wrong</li><li>Did you type your case number correctly? The numbers can be tricky, make sure you type it exactly as it appears on your summons</li><li>Did you choose the correct court location? Look carefully at your summons<ul><li>there is a different justice court for Salt Lake <i>City </i>and Salt Lake <i>County</i></li></ul>
</li></ul>
<p>If you still have problems, email <a href="mailto:odr&#64;utcourts.gov">odr&#64;utcourts.gov</a></p>
<p><b>Do you have a disability, no internet, or trouble understanding English?</b><br />
You can ask the court to be excused from ODR. File this form:</p>
<ul><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="3006SC" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">3006SC - Request to be Excused from Online Dispute Resolution and Order on Request</span></li></ul>
<p>After you log in, read below to get more guidance. </p>
<p><a href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/urapdocs/13.pdf"><sub>Utah Supreme Court Standing Order Number 13</sub></a></p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion_1915114442/item_1739399065748/accordion/item_1739399175289/text.forms.html"/></div>

    
</div>

        </div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-810a9f1dab-item-3011d9097e&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Step 2 - Work with the facilitator&#34;}}" id="accordion-810a9f1dab-item-3011d9097e">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-810a9f1dab-item-3011d9097e-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-810a9f1dab-item-3011d9097e-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Step 2 - Work with the facilitator">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Step 2 - Work with the facilitator</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-810a9f1dab-item-3011d9097e-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-810a9f1dab-item-3011d9097e-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">
    
    <div id="container-3011d9097e" class="cmp-container" style="background-color:rgba(127,127,127,0.17);">
        <div class="cmp-container-inner">
            


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-6c430fc884&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:56:42Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;div>A neutral court helper called a facilitator will talk to both of you. They are not on anyone&#39;s side. They will help you resolve your case, but they are not a judge and cannot decide who will win. They can explain things but cannot predict outcomes or decide legal issues.&lt;/div>\r\n&lt;div>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div>\r\n&lt;div>Everyone will chat online. Even if you are logged out, you will receive an email or text when there are new messages.&lt;/div>\r\n&lt;div>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div>\r\n&lt;h6>&lt;b>The facilitator&#39;s job is to:&lt;/b>&lt;/h6>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Guide:&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;help everyone use ODR and try to settle&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Inform:&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;give details about the process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Ask:&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;pose questions about proof to help everyone understand the issues&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Manage time:&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;there is a 14 day deadline to settle but they can&amp;nbsp;extend the limit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Give voice and check understanding:&lt;/b> make sure everyone has a chance to talk and understands any agreement that is reached&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Communicate privately:&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;talk privately with anyone to help find a solution&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Finalize agreement or send to trial:&lt;/b> send a final agreement to the court or send the case to be set for a trial&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;sub>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/urapdocs/13.pdf\&#34;>Utah Supreme Court Standing Order Number 13&lt;/a>(6)&lt;/sub>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-6c430fc884" class="cmp-text">
    <div>A neutral court helper called a facilitator will talk to both of you. They are not on anyone&#39;s side. They will help you resolve your case, but they are not a judge and cannot decide who will win. They can explain things but cannot predict outcomes or decide legal issues.</div>
<div> </div>
<div>Everyone will chat online. Even if you are logged out, you will receive an email or text when there are new messages.</div>
<div> </div>
<h6><b>The facilitator&#39;s job is to:</b></h6>
<ul><li><b>Guide:</b> help everyone use ODR and try to settle</li><li><b>Inform:</b> give details about the process </li><li><b>Ask:</b> pose questions about proof to help everyone understand the issues</li><li><b>Manage time:</b> there is a 14 day deadline to settle but they can extend the limit </li><li><b>Give voice and check understanding:</b> make sure everyone has a chance to talk and understands any agreement that is reached</li><li><b>Communicate privately:</b> talk privately with anyone to help find a solution</li><li><b>Finalize agreement or send to trial:</b> send a final agreement to the court or send the case to be set for a trial</li></ul>
<p><sub><a href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/urapdocs/13.pdf">Utah Supreme Court Standing Order Number 13</a>(6)</sub></p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion_1915114442/item_1739399065748/accordion/item_1739399217742/text_copy.forms.html"/></div>

    
</div>

        </div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-810a9f1dab-item-9f67c7f926&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Step 3 - Share your proof in ODR&#34;}}" id="accordion-810a9f1dab-item-9f67c7f926">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-810a9f1dab-item-9f67c7f926-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-810a9f1dab-item-9f67c7f926-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Step 3 - Share your proof in ODR">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Step 3 - Share your proof in ODR</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-810a9f1dab-item-9f67c7f926-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-810a9f1dab-item-9f67c7f926-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">
    
    <div id="container-9f67c7f926" class="cmp-container" style="background-color:rgba(127,127,127,0.17);">
        <div class="cmp-container-inner">
            


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-729aebe4be&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:53:10Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Check your file:&lt;/b>&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Make sure your proof is saved as a picture or a PDF&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Supported file types are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=\&#34;font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Regular&amp;quot; , sans-serif;\&#34;>PDF&lt;/b> (documents),&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=\&#34;font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Regular&amp;quot; , sans-serif;\&#34;>JPG, JPEG, PNG, GIF&lt;/b> (pictures)&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>If your file is not one of these types, you might need to convert it or get help&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b style=\&#34;font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Regular&amp;quot; , sans-serif;\&#34;>Find the paperclip button&amp;nbsp;&lt;b data-rte-class=\&#34;rte-temp\&#34;>&lt;span class=\&#34;custom-icon-wrapper\&#34;>&lt;b data-rte-class=\&#34;rte-temp\&#34;>&lt;span class=\&#34;filler-icon-prefix\&#34;>1&lt;/span>&lt;/b>&lt;svg class=\&#34;svg-inline--fa fa-paperclip\&#34; data-prefix=\&#34;fal\&#34; data-icon=\&#34;paperclip\&#34; role=\&#34;img\&#34; xmlns=\&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\&#34; viewbox=\&#34;0 0 448 512\&#34;>&lt;path fill=\&#34;currentColor\&#34; d=\&#34;M380.7 67.3c-29.1-29.1-76.3-29.1-105.4 0l-192 192c-46.8 46.8-46.8 122.6 0 169.4s122.6 46.8 169.4 0l152-152c6.2-6.2 16.4-6.2 22.6 0s6.2 16.4 0 22.6l-152 152c-59.3 59.3-155.4 59.3-214.6 0S1.4 296 60.7 236.7l192-192c41.6-41.6 109-41.6 150.6 0s41.6 109 0 150.6L219.5 379.1c-28.2 28.2-74.6 25.6-99.6-5.5c-21.3-26.6-19.2-65 4.9-89.1L276.7 132.7c6.2-6.2 16.4-6.2 22.6 0s6.2 16.4 0 22.6L147.5 307.1c-12.6 12.6-13.7 32.6-2.6 46.5c13 16.2 37.2 17.6 51.9 2.9L380.7 172.7c29.1-29.1 29.1-76.3 0-105.4z\&#34;>&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>&lt;b data-rte-class=\&#34;rte-temp\&#34;>&lt;span class=\&#34;filler-icon-prefix\&#34;>1&lt;/span>&lt;/b>&lt;/span>&lt;/b>&lt;/b>&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Look to the left of the chat window and tap the button&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b style=\&#34;font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Regular&amp;quot; , sans-serif;\&#34;>Select your file:&lt;/b>&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>A window will open - choose the document type and title&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Tap the file you want to share&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b style=\&#34;font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Regular&amp;quot; , sans-serif;\&#34;>Attach the file:&lt;/b>&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>If your file type is supported, you will see an &lt;b style=\&#34;font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Regular&amp;quot; , sans-serif;\&#34;>&amp;quot;Attach&amp;quot;&lt;/b> button&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span style=\&#34;font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Regular&amp;quot; , sans-serif;\&#34;>Tap&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>&lt;b style=\&#34;font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Regular&amp;quot; , sans-serif;\&#34;>&amp;quot;Attach&amp;quot;&lt;/b> to add your file to the chat&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b style=\&#34;font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Regular&amp;quot; , sans-serif;\&#34;>Confirm sharing:&lt;/b>&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Your file will appear in the chat and everyone will see it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&lt;h6>&lt;b>Important Notes:&lt;/b>&lt;/h6>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>What you upload to ODR is &lt;b>not&lt;/b> part of your court case - it cannot be used in court without your permission&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Keep Copies of Your Proof&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>If you do not settle and need the court to see your proof, you will have to show it at trial&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;sub>&lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;https://le.utah.gov/xcode/Title78B/Chapter6/78B-6-S208.html\&#34;>Utah Code 78B-6-208&lt;/a>(2) and (3)&lt;/sub>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-729aebe4be" class="cmp-text">
    <ol><li><b>Check your file:</b><ul><li>Make sure your proof is saved as a picture or a PDF</li><li>Supported file types are: <b style="	font-family: &#34;Roboto Regular&#34; , sans-serif;
">PDF</b> (documents), <b style="	font-family: &#34;Roboto Regular&#34; , sans-serif;
">JPG, JPEG, PNG, GIF</b> (pictures)</li><li>If your file is not one of these types, you might need to convert it or get help</li></ul>
</li><li><b style="	font-family: &#34;Roboto Regular&#34; , sans-serif;
">Find the paperclip button <b data-rte-class="rte-temp"><span class="custom-icon-wrapper"><b data-rte-class="rte-temp"><span class="filler-icon-prefix">1</span></b><svg class="svg-inline--fa fa-paperclip" data-prefix="fal" data-icon="paperclip" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M380.7 67.3c-29.1-29.1-76.3-29.1-105.4 0l-192 192c-46.8 46.8-46.8 122.6 0 169.4s122.6 46.8 169.4 0l152-152c6.2-6.2 16.4-6.2 22.6 0s6.2 16.4 0 22.6l-152 152c-59.3 59.3-155.4 59.3-214.6 0S1.4 296 60.7 236.7l192-192c41.6-41.6 109-41.6 150.6 0s41.6 109 0 150.6L219.5 379.1c-28.2 28.2-74.6 25.6-99.6-5.5c-21.3-26.6-19.2-65 4.9-89.1L276.7 132.7c6.2-6.2 16.4-6.2 22.6 0s6.2 16.4 0 22.6L147.5 307.1c-12.6 12.6-13.7 32.6-2.6 46.5c13 16.2 37.2 17.6 51.9 2.9L380.7 172.7c29.1-29.1 29.1-76.3 0-105.4z"></path></svg><b data-rte-class="rte-temp"><span class="filler-icon-prefix">1</span></b></span></b></b><ul><li>Look to the left of the chat window and tap the button</li></ul>
</li><li><b style="	font-family: &#34;Roboto Regular&#34; , sans-serif;
">Select your file:</b><ul><li>A window will open - choose the document type and title</li><li>Tap the file you want to share</li></ul>
</li><li><b style="	font-family: &#34;Roboto Regular&#34; , sans-serif;
">Attach the file:</b><ul><li>If your file type is supported, you will see an <b style="	font-family: &#34;Roboto Regular&#34; , sans-serif;
">&#34;Attach&#34;</b> button</li><li><span style="	font-family: &#34;Roboto Regular&#34; , sans-serif;
">Tap </span><b style="	font-family: &#34;Roboto Regular&#34; , sans-serif;
">&#34;Attach&#34;</b> to add your file to the chat</li></ul>
</li><li><b style="	font-family: &#34;Roboto Regular&#34; , sans-serif;
">Confirm sharing:</b><ul><li>Your file will appear in the chat and everyone will see it </li></ul>
</li></ol>
<h6><b>Important Notes:</b></h6>
<ul><li>What you upload to ODR is <b>not</b> part of your court case - it cannot be used in court without your permission</li><li>Keep Copies of Your Proof<ul><li>If you do not settle and need the court to see your proof, you will have to show it at trial</li></ul>
</li></ul>
<p><sub><a class="rfcu-link" href="https://le.utah.gov/xcode/Title78B/Chapter6/78B-6-S208.html">Utah Code 78B-6-208</a>(2) and (3)</sub></p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion_1915114442/item_1739399065748/accordion/item_1739399242216/text_copy_copy.forms.html"/></div>

    
</div>

        </div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-733522a943&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T23:06:40Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;h3>Other issues&lt;/h3>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-733522a943" class="cmp-text">
    <h3>Other issues</h3>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion_1915114442/item_1739399065748/text_659416548_copy.forms.html"/></div>
<div class="accordion panelcontainer aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><div id="accordion-c7f9815a08" class="cmp-accordion " data-cmp-is="accordion" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-c7f9815a08&#34;:{&#34;shownItems&#34;:[],&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T23:08:03Z&#34;}}" data-placeholder-text="false">
    <div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-c7f9815a08-item-ae2d440dd2&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Mediation instead of ODR&#34;}}" id="accordion-c7f9815a08-item-ae2d440dd2">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-c7f9815a08-item-ae2d440dd2-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-c7f9815a08-item-ae2d440dd2-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Mediation instead of ODR">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Mediation instead of ODR</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-c7f9815a08-item-ae2d440dd2-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-c7f9815a08-item-ae2d440dd2-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">
    
    <div id="container-ae2d440dd2" class="cmp-container" style="background-color:rgba(127,127,127,0.17);">
        <div class="cmp-container-inner">
            


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-bfce367089&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-02-12T22:46:43Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Your facilitator might ask if you want to mediate instead of using ODR. In mediation:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>A mediator (like a facilitator) helps you talk about your case and reach an agreement&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>You join a video call where everyone is online at the same time&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>You talk instead of sending chat messages&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>You might talk with everyone or just with the mediator, based on what is most helpful&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>Mediation can be helpful if you have a long history with the defendant.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Key Points:&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Everyone must agree to mediate&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>The mediator will schedule the time and send a link for the video call&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Make sure you have a strong internet connection and enough battery on your phone or computer&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-bfce367089" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Your facilitator might ask if you want to mediate instead of using ODR. In mediation:</p>
<ul><li>A mediator (like a facilitator) helps you talk about your case and reach an agreement</li><li>You join a video call where everyone is online at the same time</li><li>You talk instead of sending chat messages</li><li>You might talk with everyone or just with the mediator, based on what is most helpful</li></ul>
<p>Mediation can be helpful if you have a long history with the defendant.</p>
<p><b>Key Points:</b></p>
<ul><li>Everyone must agree to mediate</li><li>The mediator will schedule the time and send a link for the video call</li><li>Make sure you have a strong internet connection and enough battery on your phone or computer</li></ul>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion_1915114442/item_1739399065748/accordion_1012312416/item_1742857629914/text_copy.forms.html"/></div>

    
</div>

        </div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-c7f9815a08-item-05e18a816c&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;If the plaintiff does not log in&#34;}}" id="accordion-c7f9815a08-item-05e18a816c">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-c7f9815a08-item-05e18a816c-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-c7f9815a08-item-05e18a816c-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="If the plaintiff does not log in">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">If the plaintiff does not log in</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-c7f9815a08-item-05e18a816c-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-c7f9815a08-item-05e18a816c-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">
    
    <div id="container-05e18a816c" class="cmp-container" style="background-color:rgba(127,127,127,0.17);">
        <div class="cmp-container-inner">
            


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-1bd5bf203d&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T23:09:16Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>If the plaintiff has not logged in, look to see when your papers were filed with the court. The plaintiff has &lt;b>7 days from the date they file to log in&lt;/b>.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If they have not logged in yet, you can file a motion asking the court to dismiss the case. See our &lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/filing/motions.html\&#34;>page on motions&lt;/a> for forms and guidance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/urapdocs/13.pdf\&#34;>&lt;sub>Utah Supreme Court Standing Order No. 13&lt;/sub>&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-1bd5bf203d" class="cmp-text">
    <p>If the plaintiff has not logged in, look to see when your papers were filed with the court. The plaintiff has <b>7 days from the date they file to log in</b>.</p>
<p>If they have not logged in yet, you can file a motion asking the court to dismiss the case. See our <a class="rfcu-link" href="/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/filing/motions.html">page on motions</a> for forms and guidance. </p>
<p><a class="rfcu-link" href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/urapdocs/13.pdf"><sub>Utah Supreme Court Standing Order No. 13</sub></a></p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion_1915114442/item_1739399065748/accordion_1012312416/item_1742857664578/text.forms.html"/></div>

    
</div>

        </div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-c7f9815a08-item-b740106609&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;If you do not settle&#34;}}" id="accordion-c7f9815a08-item-b740106609">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-c7f9815a08-item-b740106609-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-c7f9815a08-item-b740106609-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="If you do not settle">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">If you do not settle</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-c7f9815a08-item-b740106609-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-c7f9815a08-item-b740106609-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">
    
    <div id="container-b740106609" class="cmp-container" style="background-color:rgba(127,127,127,0.17);">
        <div class="cmp-container-inner">
            


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-75e86c1285&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T23:08:39Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>If you and the other side cannot agree, your case will go to trial in about 7-21 days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;b>Be sure to attend your trial, or you will lose your case automatically.&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>A trial is different from ODR. The judge will only decide if you owe the money the plaintiff says you owe. The judge cannot give you a payment plan. If you owe the money, you must pay all of it. If you cannot pay, the plaintiff could &lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/garnishment/rights.html\&#34;>garnish your wages&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>At the trial,&lt;b>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b>bring any proof that helps your case, like photos, receipts, messages, or witnesses. The judge will look at everything you bring and decide whether it can be used.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Do your best to get ready for your trial ahead of time. This will be your only chance to convince the judge that you should win. Read about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/pro-se.html\&#34;>Going to Court&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;to help you get ready.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Do you need to change your trial date?&lt;/b>&lt;br>\r\nYou can ask for a different date if you have a good reason. File these papers:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span data-rte-class=\&#34;rte-temp\&#34;>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1037XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1037XX&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span data-rte-class=\&#34;rte-temp\&#34;>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1038XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1038XX&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>If the court grants your request, they will tell the other party.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type=srpe&amp;amp;rule=6\&#34;>&lt;/a>&lt;sub>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/urapdocs/13.pdf\&#34;>Utah Supreme Court Standing Order Number 13&lt;/a>(8). &lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type=srpe&amp;amp;rule=6\&#34;>Rule of Small Claims Procedure 6&lt;/a>&lt;/sub>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-75e86c1285" class="cmp-text">
    <p>If you and the other side cannot agree, your case will go to trial in about 7-21 days. <b>Be sure to attend your trial, or you will lose your case automatically.</b>  </p>
<p>A trial is different from ODR. The judge will only decide if you owe the money the plaintiff says you owe. The judge cannot give you a payment plan. If you owe the money, you must pay all of it. If you cannot pay, the plaintiff could <a class="rfcu-link" href="/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/garnishment/rights.html">garnish your wages</a>.</p>
<p>At the trial,<b> </b>bring any proof that helps your case, like photos, receipts, messages, or witnesses. The judge will look at everything you bring and decide whether it can be used.</p>
<p>Do your best to get ready for your trial ahead of time. This will be your only chance to convince the judge that you should win. Read about <a href="/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/pro-se.html">Going to Court</a> to help you get ready.</p>
<p><b>Do you need to change your trial date?</b><br />
You can ask for a different date if you have a good reason. File these papers:</p>
<ul><li><span data-rte-class="rte-temp"><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1037XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1037XX</span></span></li><li><span data-rte-class="rte-temp"><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1038XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1038XX</span></span></li></ul>
<p>If the court grants your request, they will tell the other party. <br />
</p>
<p><a class="rfcu-link" href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type&#61;srpe&amp;rule&#61;6"></a><sub><a href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/urapdocs/13.pdf">Utah Supreme Court Standing Order Number 13</a>(8). <a class="rfcu-link" href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type&#61;srpe&amp;rule&#61;6">Rule of Small Claims Procedure 6</a></sub></p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion_1915114442/item_1739399065748/accordion_1012312416/item_1742857675701/text.forms.html"/></div>

    
</div>

        </div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>

    
</div>

        </div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-71e19b36a9&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-02-13T20:58:41Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;It says I have to go to trial&#34;}}" id="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-71e19b36a9">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-71e19b36a9-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-71e19b36a9-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="It says I have to go to trial">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">It says I have to go to trial</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-71e19b36a9-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-71e19b36a9-button"><div class="text">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-71e19b36a9&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-02-13T20:58:41Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>If the summons has a trial date, &lt;b>be sure to attend or you will lose your case automatically&lt;/b>.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>At the trial, the judge might ask you to try to settle with the other side. If you do not settle and the trial starts,&amp;nbsp;the judge will only decide if you owe the money the plaintiff says you owe. The judge cannot give you a payment plan. If you owe the money, you must pay all of it. If you cannot pay, the plaintiff could&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/garnishment/rights.html\&#34;>garnish your wages&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>At the trial,&amp;nbsp;bring any proof that helps your case, like photos, receipts, messages, or witnesses. The judge will look at everything you bring and decide whether it can be used. &lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Do your best to get ready for your trial ahead of time. This will be your only chance to convince the judge that you should win. Read about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/pro-se.html\&#34;>Going to Court&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;to help you get ready.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>You might have other options. &lt;/b>&lt;br>\r\nScroll down to &amp;quot;what are my other options&amp;quot; to learn more.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-71e19b36a9" class="cmp-text">
    <p>If the summons has a trial date, <b>be sure to attend or you will lose your case automatically</b>. </p>
<p>At the trial, the judge might ask you to try to settle with the other side. If you do not settle and the trial starts, the judge will only decide if you owe the money the plaintiff says you owe. The judge cannot give you a payment plan. If you owe the money, you must pay all of it. If you cannot pay, the plaintiff could <a href="/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/garnishment/rights.html">garnish your wages</a>.</p>
<p>At the trial, bring any proof that helps your case, like photos, receipts, messages, or witnesses. The judge will look at everything you bring and decide whether it can be used. </p>
<p>Do your best to get ready for your trial ahead of time. This will be your only chance to convince the judge that you should win. Read about <a href="/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/pro-se.html">Going to Court</a> to help you get ready.</p>
<p><b>You might have other options. </b><br />
Scroll down to &#34;what are my other options&#34; to learn more.</p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion_1915114442/item_1692994964437.forms.html"/></div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-06acc4d0ac&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2024-10-23T20:34:05Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;What are my other options?&#34;}}" id="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-06acc4d0ac">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-06acc4d0ac-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-06acc4d0ac-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="What are my other options?">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">What are my other options?</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-06acc4d0ac-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-06acc4d0ac-button"><div class="accordion panelcontainer"><div id="accordion-06acc4d0ac" class="cmp-accordion " data-cmp-is="accordion" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-06acc4d0ac&#34;:{&#34;shownItems&#34;:[],&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2024-10-23T20:34:05Z&#34;}}" data-placeholder-text="false">
    <div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-ed13cda52e&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:55:54Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Sue the plaintiff back&#34;}}" id="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-ed13cda52e">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-ed13cda52e-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-ed13cda52e-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Sue the plaintiff back">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Sue the plaintiff back</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-ed13cda52e-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-ed13cda52e-button"><div class="text">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-ed13cda52e&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:55:54Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>If you want, you can sue the plaintiff back, saying they are owe you money. There are some limits to small claims:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>You can only sue someone to get money in small claims cases. You cannot ask the court to order the other person to do something (like give back property). The most you can ask for is $20,000. That amount includes lawyer fees, but does not include court costs or interest.&lt;br>\r\n&lt;sub>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.utcourts.gov/statutes/?s=78A-8-102\&#34;>Utah Code Section 78A-8-102&lt;/a>.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/sub>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>You cannot sue a government agency or sue to evict someone. You might want advice if your case doesn’t fit these limits. See our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/legal-help/finding-legal-help/legal-assist.html\&#34;>Finding Legal Help page&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;to learn more.&lt;br>\r\n&lt;sub>Utah Code&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.utcourts.gov/statutes/?s=63G-7-201\&#34;>63G-7-201&lt;/a>, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.utcourts.gov/statutes/?s=78A-8-102\&#34;>78A-8-102&lt;/a>.&lt;/sub>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;br>\r\nFill out these forms:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1024XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1024XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1031XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1031XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>After filling out your forms,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html\&#34;>file them&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;with the justice court where your case was filed. There is a filing fee (check the cover sheet for the amount). If you cannot afford the fee you can ask for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/waiver.html\&#34;>fee waiver&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Once you file, &lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;https://www.utcourts.gov/en/legal-help/legal-help/procedures/service/service-of-process.html#Papers\&#34;>serve the papers&lt;/a> on the plaintiff.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If you go to trial, the court will consider your claims at that point.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-ed13cda52e" class="cmp-text">
    <p>If you want, you can sue the plaintiff back, saying they are owe you money. There are some limits to small claims:</p>
<ul><li>You can only sue someone to get money in small claims cases. You cannot ask the court to order the other person to do something (like give back property). The most you can ask for is $20,000. That amount includes lawyer fees, but does not include court costs or interest.<br />
<sub><a href="https://www.utcourts.gov/statutes/?s&#61;78A-8-102">Utah Code Section 78A-8-102</a>. </sub></li><li>You cannot sue a government agency or sue to evict someone. You might want advice if your case doesn’t fit these limits. See our <a href="/en/self-help/legal-help/finding-legal-help/legal-assist.html">Finding Legal Help page</a> to learn more.<br />
<sub>Utah Code <a href="https://www.utcourts.gov/statutes/?s&#61;63G-7-201">63G-7-201</a>, and <a href="https://www.utcourts.gov/statutes/?s&#61;78A-8-102">78A-8-102</a>.</sub></li></ul>
<p><br />
Fill out these forms:</p>
<ul><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1024XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1024XX</span></li><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1031XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1031XX</span></li></ul>
<p>After filling out your forms, <a href="/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html">file them</a> with the justice court where your case was filed. There is a filing fee (check the cover sheet for the amount). If you cannot afford the fee you can ask for a <a href="/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/waiver.html">fee waiver</a>.</p>
<p>Once you file, <a class="rfcu-link" href="https://www.utcourts.gov/en/legal-help/legal-help/procedures/service/service-of-process.html#Papers">serve the papers</a> on the plaintiff.</p>
<p>If you go to trial, the court will consider your claims at that point.</p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion_1915114442/item_1693446502666/item_1.forms.html"/></div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-34e3e93143&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:54:31Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Ask to change the trial date&#34;}}" id="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-34e3e93143">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-34e3e93143-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-34e3e93143-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Ask to change the trial date">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Ask to change the trial date</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-34e3e93143-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-34e3e93143-button"><div class="text">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-34e3e93143&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:54:31Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>You can ask to change the trial date if you have a good reason. File these papers:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1037XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1037XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1038XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1038XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>If the court grants your request, they will tell the other party.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;sub>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type=srpe&amp;amp;rule=6\&#34;>Rule of Small Claims Procedure 6&lt;/a>.&lt;/sub>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-34e3e93143" class="cmp-text">
    <p>You can ask to change the trial date if you have a good reason. File these papers:</p>
<ul><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1037XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1037XX</span></li><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1038XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1038XX</span></li></ul>
<p>If the court grants your request, they will tell the other party. <br />
</p>
<p><sub><a href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type&#61;srpe&amp;rule&#61;6">Rule of Small Claims Procedure 6</a>.</sub></p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion_1915114442/item_1693446502666/item_1693446539418.forms.html"/></div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-cb11dd1685&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:55:38Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Ask for a trial in front of a jury&#34;}}" id="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-cb11dd1685">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-cb11dd1685-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-cb11dd1685-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Ask for a trial in front of a jury">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Ask for a trial in front of a jury</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-cb11dd1685-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-cb11dd1685-button"><div class="text">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-cb11dd1685&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:55:38Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>District courts handle bigger cases. If you want a jury trial, your case will move there. &lt;b>You must do this within 15 days of getting your papers&lt;/b>.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Follow these steps:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>Find the closest district court that is in the &lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/about/miscellaneous/directory/map-of-judicial-districts.html\&#34;>same judicial district&lt;/a>. Use the &lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/about/miscellaneous/directory.html\&#34;>court directory&lt;/a>. File in the court closest to you in the same district.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>File this form with the district court:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1030XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1030XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Pay the $250 jury fee to the district court.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>File this form with the justice court:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1028XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1028XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&lt;p>The justice court will send its records to the district court. Ask the district court about scheduling.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>After removal, district court rules apply - not small claims rules.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;sub>&lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type=srpe&amp;amp;rule=4A\&#34;>Utah Rule of Small Claims Procedure 4A&lt;/a>.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/sub>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>When preparing, you may need someone to testify or provide documents. You can make them testify or provide documents with a subpoena. Read our &lt;a class=\&#34;rfcu-link\&#34; href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/subpoena.html\&#34;>subpoena page&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-cb11dd1685" class="cmp-text">
    <p>District courts handle bigger cases. If you want a jury trial, your case will move there. <b>You must do this within 15 days of getting your papers</b>.</p>
<p>Follow these steps:</p>
<ol><li>Find the closest district court that is in the <a class="rfcu-link" href="/en/about/miscellaneous/directory/map-of-judicial-districts.html">same judicial district</a>. Use the <a class="rfcu-link" href="/en/about/miscellaneous/directory.html">court directory</a>. File in the court closest to you in the same district.</li><li>File this form with the district court: <span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1030XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1030XX</span></li><li>Pay the $250 jury fee to the district court. </li><li>File this form with the justice court: <span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1028XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1028XX</span></li></ol>
<p>The justice court will send its records to the district court. Ask the district court about scheduling.</p>
<p>After removal, district court rules apply - not small claims rules. <br />
</p>
<p><sub><a class="rfcu-link" href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type&#61;srpe&amp;rule&#61;4A">Utah Rule of Small Claims Procedure 4A</a>. </sub><br />
</p>
<p> </p>
<p>When preparing, you may need someone to testify or provide documents. You can make them testify or provide documents with a subpoena. Read our <a class="rfcu-link" href="/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/subpoena.html">subpoena page</a>.</p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion_1915114442/item_1693446502666/item_1693446551603.forms.html"/></div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-a3ead5ba57&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Skip ODR if you have a disability, do not have internet access, or you do not speak English&#34;}}" id="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-a3ead5ba57">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-a3ead5ba57-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-a3ead5ba57-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Skip ODR if you have a disability, do not have internet access, or you do not speak English">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Skip ODR if you have a disability, do not have internet access, or you do not speak English</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-a3ead5ba57-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-06acc4d0ac-item-a3ead5ba57-button"><div class="container responsivegrid">
    
    <div id="container-a3ead5ba57" class="cmp-container" style="background-color:rgba(127,127,127,0.17);">
        <div class="cmp-container-inner">
            


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-c0dccc91f6&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2024-10-23T20:34:46Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>If you can’t use ODR because of a disability, no internet access, or you don’t speak English, you can ask for a trial and skip ODR. File this form:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Request to be Excused from Online Dispute Resolution and Order on Request&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/odr/docs/Request%20to%20be%20Excused%20from%20Online%20Dispute%20Resolution.pdf\&#34;>PDF Form&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/odr/docs/Request%20to%20be%20Excused%20from%20Online%20Dispute%20Resolution.doc\&#34;>Fillable Form&lt;/a>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>After filling out your form,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.utcourts.gov/en/legal-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html\&#34;>file it&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;with the justice court.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-c0dccc91f6" class="cmp-text">
    <p>If you can’t use ODR because of a disability, no internet access, or you don’t speak English, you can ask for a trial and skip ODR. File this form:</p>
<ul><li>Request to be Excused from Online Dispute Resolution and Order on Request <a href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/odr/docs/Request%20to%20be%20Excused%20from%20Online%20Dispute%20Resolution.pdf">PDF Form</a> | <a href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/odr/docs/Request%20to%20be%20Excused%20from%20Online%20Dispute%20Resolution.doc">Fillable Form</a></li></ul>
<p>After filling out your form, <a href="https://www.utcourts.gov/en/legal-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html">file it</a> with the justice court.</p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion_1915114442/item_1693446502666/item_1729715455600/text.forms.html"/></div>

    
</div>

        </div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-87c3f98028&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-11-30T02:31:20Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Next Steps&#34;}}" id="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-87c3f98028">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-87c3f98028-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-87c3f98028-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Next Steps">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Next Steps</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-87c3f98028-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-1ea2ce176a-item-87c3f98028-button"><div class="accordion panelcontainer"><div id="accordion-87c3f98028" class="cmp-accordion " data-cmp-is="accordion" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-87c3f98028&#34;:{&#34;shownItems&#34;:[],&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-11-30T02:31:20Z&#34;}}" data-placeholder-text="false">
    <div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-87c3f98028-item-56402208e1&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2024-07-22T21:26:53Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;My case is in ODR, the Plaintiff failed to respond&#34;}}" id="accordion-87c3f98028-item-56402208e1">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-87c3f98028-item-56402208e1-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-87c3f98028-item-56402208e1-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="My case is in ODR, the Plaintiff failed to respond">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">My case is in ODR, the Plaintiff failed to respond</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-87c3f98028-item-56402208e1-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-87c3f98028-item-56402208e1-button"><div class="text">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-56402208e1&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2024-07-22T21:26:53Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>If you had to register for ODR, there are special rules that apply. You and the person suing you (the plaintiff) must talk with a facilitator to try to settle your case.&amp;nbsp;If the plaintiff does not respond after 10 days, you can ask the court to dismiss the case. This means you win. But the plaintiff can sue again later if they want.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If you want to the case dismissed, follow the steps below.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Fill out these forms:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;2021SC\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>2021SC&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;2022SC\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>2022SC&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>After filling out your forms,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.utcourts.gov/en/legal-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html\&#34;>file them&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;with the justice court listed on your court papers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Once you file,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.utcourts.gov/en/legal-help/legal-help/procedures/service/service-of-process.html#Papers\&#34;>serve the papers&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;on the plaintiff.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If the court schdules a hearing, be sure to attend.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-56402208e1" class="cmp-text">
    <p>If you had to register for ODR, there are special rules that apply. You and the person suing you (the plaintiff) must talk with a facilitator to try to settle your case. If the plaintiff does not respond after 10 days, you can ask the court to dismiss the case. This means you win. But the plaintiff can sue again later if they want. </p>
<p>If you want to the case dismissed, follow the steps below.</p>
<p>Fill out these forms:</p>
<ul><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="2021SC" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">2021SC</span></li><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="2022SC" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">2022SC</span></li></ul>
<p>After filling out your forms, <a href="https://www.utcourts.gov/en/legal-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html">file them</a> with the justice court listed on your court papers. </p>
<p>Once you file, <a href="https://www.utcourts.gov/en/legal-help/legal-help/procedures/service/service-of-process.html#Papers">serve the papers</a> on the plaintiff.</p>
<p>If the court schdules a hearing, be sure to attend.</p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion_1915114442/item_1699919191572/item_1701311327288.forms.html"/></div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-87c3f98028-item-6494c2a27c&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-11-13T23:49:11Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Enforcing a Settlement Agreement&#34;}}" id="accordion-87c3f98028-item-6494c2a27c">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-87c3f98028-item-6494c2a27c-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-87c3f98028-item-6494c2a27c-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Enforcing a Settlement Agreement">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Enforcing a Settlement Agreement</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-87c3f98028-item-6494c2a27c-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-87c3f98028-item-6494c2a27c-button"><div class="text">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-6494c2a27c&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-11-13T23:49:11Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>If you came to an agreement either in ODR or before your trial, you can ask for help from the court in enforcing your settlement. Follow these steps.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Step 1 - file these forms&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html\&#34;>File your papers&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;with the justice court where your case was originally filed.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1033XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1033XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1034XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1034XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Step 2 - serve the other party&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.utcourts.gov/en/legal-help/legal-help/procedures/service/service-of-process.html#Papers\&#34;>Serve the other party&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;with the papers you file.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Step 3 - attend the hearing&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>When you file, the court will schedule a hearing. Be sure to attend.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If the court rules in your favor, you might get a judgment. Read about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/judgment.html\&#34;>How to Collect a Judgment&lt;/a>.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-6494c2a27c" class="cmp-text">
    <p>If you came to an agreement either in ODR or before your trial, you can ask for help from the court in enforcing your settlement. Follow these steps.</p>
<p><b>Step 1 - file these forms</b></p>
<p><a href="/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html">File your papers</a> with the justice court where your case was originally filed.</p>
<ul><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1033XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1033XX</span></li><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1034XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1034XX</span></li></ul>
<p><b>Step 2 - serve the other party</b></p>
<p><a href="https://www.utcourts.gov/en/legal-help/legal-help/procedures/service/service-of-process.html#Papers">Serve the other party</a> with the papers you file.</p>
<p><b>Step 3 - attend the hearing</b></p>
<p>When you file, the court will schedule a hearing. Be sure to attend.</p>
<p>If the court rules in your favor, you might get a judgment. Read about <a href="/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/judgment.html">How to Collect a Judgment</a>. </p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion_1915114442/item_1699919191572/item_1699916407736.forms.html"/></div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-87c3f98028-item-a392ae502c&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:55:12Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;After trial&#34;}}" id="accordion-87c3f98028-item-a392ae502c">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-87c3f98028-item-a392ae502c-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-87c3f98028-item-a392ae502c-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="After trial">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">After trial</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-87c3f98028-item-a392ae502c-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-87c3f98028-item-a392ae502c-button"><div class="text">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-a392ae502c&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-03-24T22:55:12Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>If you go to trial the judge will usually decide who wins immediatly. If not, they have 60 days to tell you what they decide.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If you filed a counterclaim and you won, the plaintiff might have to pay you. If they do not pay, see our page on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/judgment.html\&#34;>How to Collect a Judgment&lt;/a>.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If you lose and think the judge made a mistake in your case, you can file an appeal. You must do this within&amp;nbsp;&lt;b>28 days&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b>of the judgment. Fill out these forms:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1044XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1044XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1045XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1045XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>Then&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html\&#34;>file the forms&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;with the court that issued the judgment. The court will charge fees for the appeal.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>The court will send your paperwork to the nearest district court within the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/utcourts/us/en/about/miscellaneous/directory/map-of-judicial-districts.html\&#34;>same judicial district&lt;/a>. The district court will schedule a trial. What happened in the first trial will not control what happens in the new trial. Bring all of your evidence and be prepared to explain why you should win.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>The court will schedule a new trial. What happened in the first trial will not control what happens in the new trial. Bring all of your evidence and be prepared to explain why you should win.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If you win, the judge might tell you to prepare the order. Use this form:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1040XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1040XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;sub>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type=srpe&amp;amp;rule=12\&#34;>Utah Rule of Small Claims Procedure 12&lt;/a>.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/sub>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-a392ae502c" class="cmp-text">
    <p>If you go to trial the judge will usually decide who wins immediatly. If not, they have 60 days to tell you what they decide.</p>
<p>If you filed a counterclaim and you won, the plaintiff might have to pay you. If they do not pay, see our page on <a href="/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/judgment.html">How to Collect a Judgment</a>. </p>
<p>If you lose and think the judge made a mistake in your case, you can file an appeal. You must do this within <b>28 days </b>of the judgment. Fill out these forms:</p>
<ul><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1044XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1044XX</span></li><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1045XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1045XX</span></li></ul>
<p>Then <a href="/en/self-help/legal-help/procedures/filing.html">file the forms</a> with the court that issued the judgment. The court will charge fees for the appeal.  </p>
<p>The court will send your paperwork to the nearest district court within the <a href="/en/about/miscellaneous/directory/map-of-judicial-districts.html">same judicial district</a>. The district court will schedule a trial. What happened in the first trial will not control what happens in the new trial. Bring all of your evidence and be prepared to explain why you should win. </p>
<p>The court will schedule a new trial. What happened in the first trial will not control what happens in the new trial. Bring all of your evidence and be prepared to explain why you should win. </p>
<p>If you win, the judge might tell you to prepare the order. Use this form:</p>
<ul><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1040XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1040XX</span></li></ul>
<p><sub><a href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/rules/view.php?type&#61;srpe&amp;rule&#61;12">Utah Rule of Small Claims Procedure 12</a>. </sub></p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion_1915114442/item_1699919191572/item_1695413049874.forms.html"/></div>
</div>
    </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-87c3f98028-item-760666bf2e&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-11-13T23:56:12Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Did you miss your trial?&#34;}}" id="accordion-87c3f98028-item-760666bf2e">
        <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
            <button id="accordion-87c3f98028-item-760666bf2e-button" class="aa-accordion cmp-accordion__button" aria-controls="accordion-87c3f98028-item-760666bf2e-panel" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-aa-tracking="Did you miss your trial?">
                <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Did you miss your trial?</span>
                <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
            </button>
        </h3>
        <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-87c3f98028-item-760666bf2e-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-87c3f98028-item-760666bf2e-button"><div class="text">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-760666bf2e&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;utcourts/components/content/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-11-13T23:56:12Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>If you missed your trial, a judgment may be entered against you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>You can ask to undo the judgment. You must ask within 15 days after judgment was entered. If it has been more than 15 days, you must explain your delay.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>File these forms to ask the court to undo the judgment:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1042XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1042XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;span class=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34; data-reference=\&#34;1043XX\&#34; data-cmp-is=\&#34;utcourts-form-id\&#34;>1043XX&lt;/span>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>The court will schedule a hearing. Make sure you attend.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-760666bf2e" class="cmp-text">
    <p>If you missed your trial, a judgment may be entered against you. </p>
<p>You can ask to undo the judgment. You must ask within 15 days after judgment was entered. If it has been more than 15 days, you must explain your delay. </p>
<p>File these forms to ask the court to undo the judgment:</p>
<ul><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1042XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1042XX</span></li><li><span class="utcourts-form-id" data-reference="1043XX" data-cmp-is="utcourts-form-id">1043XX</span></li></ul>
<p>The court will schedule a hearing. Make sure you attend. </p>
<p> </p>

</div>

    

<input class="utcourts-text-forms-id-url" type="hidden" name="ignore" value="/content/utcourts/us/en/self-help/case-categories/consumer/small-claims/jcr:content/root/container/container/columncontainer/col-2-2-2/accordion_1915114442/item_1699919191572/item_1699916123788.forms.html"/></div>
</div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
    </div>

    
</div>
</div>
